  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thewizardshell/froggit/zipball/v1.4.0-beta",
  "body": " > [!WARNING]\r\n  > If you are on any version below `v1.4.0-beta`, this is the last version you need to install manually. Please reinstall using\r\n  the script for your platform before future updates work.\r\n\r\n  **Linux / macOS**\r\n  ```bash\r\n  curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thewizardshell/froggit/master/scripts/install.sh | bash\r\n  ```\r\n  Windows\r\n  ```bash\r\n  iwr -useb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thewizardshell/froggit/master/scripts/install.ps1 | iex\r\n  ```\r\n  # Auto-Updater\r\n\r\n  Froggit can now update itself. From this version onwards just run:\r\n  ```bash\r\n  froggit --update\r\n  ```\r\n  It will detect if a newer version is available, show the release notes, and replace the binary automatically.\r\n\r\n  Changes\r\n\r\n  - froggit --update — check and apply updates in one command\r\n  - Version injected automatically from git tag at build time"
}
